{"title":"미친 오빠를 주웠다 [19세 완전판]","thumbnail":null,"synopsis":"“내가 궁금한 건 딱 두 가지야.”“그, 그게 뭔데요?”“우리 속궁합. 그리고 침실이 어딘지. 난 그 두 가지만 알면 돼.”깨닫는 덴 오래 걸리지 않았다.발라 먹긴 개뿔, 뼛속까지 발라 먹힐 치명적인 실수였다는 걸.“이렇게 예쁜 속살은 처음 봐. 기억을 잃기 전엔 실컷 봤겠지만.”주워 온 건 첫사랑이 아니었다. “엉망으로 만들어줘야겠어. 처음부터 그럴 생각이긴 했지만.” 다리 사이에 악마의 뿔을 단, 날 것 그대로의 미친 수컷이었다.ⓒ소민,이치광(원작:골드드럼)/메타툰","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":192,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":240,"change":{"type":"down","amount":48}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":260,"change":{"type":"down","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":281,"change":{"type":"down","amount":21}},{"date":"2026-09-08","rank":297,"change":{"type":"down","amount":16}},{"date":"2026-09-09","rank":265,"change":{"type":"up","amount":32}},{"date":"2026-09-10","rank":265,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-11","rank":244,"change":{"type":"up","amount":21}},{"date":"2026-09-12","rank":288,"change":{"type":"down","amount":44}},{"date":"2026-09-13","rank":294,"change":{"type":"down","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-09-15","rank":291,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-16","rank":263,"change":{"type":"up","amount":28}}],"weekly":[],"monthly":[]},"viewSeries":[],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-07","v":476578,"rc":819,"rs":8034,"cc":127},{"date":"2026-10-08","v":479016,"rc":822,"rs":8064,"cc":127},{"date":"2026-10-09","v":481527,"rc":824,"rs":8084,"cc":127},{"date":"2026-10-10","v":483834,"rc":826,"rs":8104,"cc":128},{"date":"2026-10-11","v":486106,"rc":828,"rs":8124,"cc":128},{"date":"2026-10-12","v":488433,"rc":829,"rs":8134,"cc":128},{"date":"2026-10-13","v":490800,"rc":833,"rs":8174,"cc":128},{"date":"2026-10-14","v":492895,"rc":838,"rs":8224,"cc":131},{"date":"2026-10-15","v":495101,"rc":842,"rs":8264,"cc":133},{"date":"2026-10-16","v":497167,"rc":844,"rs":8284,"cc":133},{"date":"2026-10-17","v":499128,"rc":846,"rs":8304,"cc":134},{"date":"2026-10-18","v":501246,"rc":848,"rs